<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42085" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rŭtābŭlum</span></b> ,
		i, n.
		ruo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an instrument for raking</i> or <i>stirring
			up.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> For fire, <i>a fire-shovel</i>, <i>oven-rake</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 10, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11,
			5</span></i>; Novat. ap. <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 262</span></i> Müll. (Com.
			Rel. p. 226 Rib.); <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug.
			75</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			For cookery, <i>a wooden shovel</i> or <i>spattle</i> for stirring and mixing liquids, <i><span class="en">Col. 12,
				20, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">12, 23,
				2</span></i>.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, = membrum virile, Naev. ap. <i><span class="en">Fest. p.
				262</span></i> Müll. (Com. Rel. p. 24 Rib.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
